<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title><%= title %> | Champion Lounge</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
</head>
<body class="landing-page">
  <header class="landing-header">
    <a class="brand" href="/"><span class="brand-mark">CL</span><span><strong>Champion</strong><small>Lounge</small></span></a>
    <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Main navigation">
      <a href="/home">Home</a><a href="/tournaments">Tournaments</a>
      <% if (currentUser) { %><a href="/dashboard">Dashboard</a><% } else { %><a href="/auth/login">Sign in</a><a class="nav-cta" href="/auth/register">Join the lounge</a><% } %>
    </nav>
  </header>
  <main class="landing-hero">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">The arena for ambition</span>
      <h1>Make every match <em>matter.</em></h1>
      <p>Compete in trusted tournaments. Build a verified record. Put your talent in front of the right people.</p>
      <div class="action-row"><a class="button" href="/auth/register">Start your journey <span>→</span></a><a class="text-link" href="/tournaments">Explore tournaments <span>↗</span></a></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stat"><strong>01</strong><span>Players first.<br>Always.</span></div>
    <div class="scroll-cue">Scroll to explore <span>↓</span></div>
  </main>
  <section class="landing-strip"><span>Built for the next generation of competitors</span><span>Verified results</span><span>Real opportunity</span><span>One competitive record</span></section>
  <section class="landing-features">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">One platform. More ways to compete.</span><h2>Find the format that fits your ambition.</h2></div>
    <div class="landing-feature-grid"><article><strong>01</strong><h3>Curated games</h3><p>Explore supported games, modes, official rules, and competition formats.</p></article><article><strong>02</strong><h3>Clear tournaments</h3><p>See dates, capacity, fees, eligibility, scoring, and published terms before you register.</p></article><article><strong>03</strong><h3>Verified progress</h3><p>Turn every completed competition into a durable, trusted competitive record.</p></article></div>
  </section>
</body>
</html>
